DeviceModelView's screen texture and material use RealityKit API from macOS 12 (TextureResource.replace and
generate, MaterialParameters, UnlitMaterial.color). The view is only made from macOS 15 on (DisplayView+Bezel's
#available), so updateFrame and updateScreenMaterial return at once before macOS 12, which lets it compile for 11.

